{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33404","headline":"寄栖白上人 · 李昌符","name":"寄栖白上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"剪髪兼成隐，将心更属文。\n无憀对豪客，不拜谒吾君。\n画壁惟泉石，经窗半典坟。\n归林幽鸟狎，乞食病僧分。\n默坐终清夜，凝思念碧云。\n相逢应未卜，余正走嚣氛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昌符","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33404.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33404","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}